The following repository validation commands were reported as passing during
M9 validation / acceptance:

$ go vet ./...
PASS

$ go test ./...
PASS

$ go test -race -p 1 ./...
PASS

$ go build ./...
PASS

$ go build -tags gui -o meshchat-gui ./cmd/meshchat-gui
PASS

Evidence provenance:
- The PASS results above are synchronized from the approved M9 implementation
