- The supplied documentation archive does not contain the complete raw stdout
  of every command, so this file intentionally records results rather than
  fabricating command transcripts.
- The race suite uses -p 1 as previously established to avoid VM CPU starvation
  causing spurious mesh handshake timeouts.

